{
  "name": "Kinto Gmail Notifications (API Key Auth)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "kinto-notifications",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        250,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonData": "={\n  \"eventType\": $json.event_type,\n  \"taskId\": $json.task_id,\n  \"taskTitle\": $json.task_title,\n  \"timestamp\": $json.timestamp,\n  \"status\": $json.status,\n  \"assigneeId\": $json.assignee_id,\n  \"hubId\": $json.hub_id\n}"
      },
      "id": "extract-payload",
      "name": "Extract Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        450,
        300
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "event-router",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.eventType }}",
              "value2": "task.created",
              "operation": "equals"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.eventType }}",
              "value2": "task.claimed",
              "operation": "equals"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.eventType }}",
              "value2": "task.completed",
              "operation": "equals"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "event-router",
      "name": "Event Router",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        650,
        300
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "broadcast-get-users",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "node": "assignment-check",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.eventType }}",
              "value2": "task.assigned",
              "operation": "equals"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "assignment-check",
      "name": "Assignment Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        850,
        500
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "assignment-get-users",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ],
          []
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://{{ $env.KINTO_API_HOST }}/api/trpc/users.getByRoleWithApiKey",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.KINTO_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "input",
              "value": "={\n  \"roleFilter\": [\"family_admin\", \"family_member\"]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "broadcast-get-users",
      "name": "Get Broadcast Recipients",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        850,
        200
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "broadcast-prepare",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://{{ $env.KINTO_API_HOST }}/api/trpc/users.getByRoleWithApiKey",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.KINTO_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "input",
              "value": "={\n  \"roleFilter\": [\"caregiver\"]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "assignment-get-users",
      "name": "Get Assigned Caregiver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        850,
        400
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "filter-assignee",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonData": "={\n  \"recipients\": $json.result.users.filter(u => u.id === $json.assigneeId)\n}"
      },
      "id": "filter-assignee",
      "name": "Filter Assignee",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1050,
        400
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "assignment-send-email",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonData": "={\n  \"recipients\": $json.result.users\n}"
      },
      "id": "broadcast-prepare",
      "name": "Prepare Recipients",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1050,
        200
      ],
      "connections": {
        "main": [
          [
            {
              "node": "broadcast-send-emails",
              "index": 0,
              "type": "main"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "{{ $env.KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.recipients.map(r => r.email).join(',') }}",
        "subject": "=[Kinto] {{ $json.eventType }} — {{ $json.taskTitle }}",
        "textOnly": false,
        "htmlEmail": "=<h2>[Kinto] {{ $json.eventType }}</h2>\n<p><strong>Task:</strong> {{ $json.taskTitle }}</p>\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> {{ $json.status }}</p>\n<p><strong>Received:</strong> {{ $json.timestamp }}</p>\n<p>Please log in to Kinto to take action.</p>",
        "credentialsType": "YOUR_LLC_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID"
      },
      "id": "broadcast-send-emails",
      "name": "Send Broadcast Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "{{ $env.KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.recipients[0]?.email }}",
        "subject": "=[Kinto] {{ $json.eventType }} — {{ $json.taskTitle }}",
        "textOnly": false,
        "htmlEmail": "=<h2>[Kinto] Task Assigned to You</h2>\n<p><strong>Task:</strong> {{ $json.taskTitle }}</p>\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> {{ $json.status }}</p>\n<p><strong>Received:</strong> {{ $json.timestamp }}</p>\n<p>You have been assigned this task. Please log in to Kinto to review details.</p>",
        "credentialsType": "YOUR_LLC_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID"
      },
      "id": "assignment-send-email",
      "name": "Send Assignment Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        400
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "webhook-trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "extract-payload",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "extract-payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "event-router",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "event-router": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "broadcast-get-users",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "assignment-check",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "assignment-check": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "assignment-get-users",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "broadcast-get-users": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "broadcast-prepare",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "assignment-get-users": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "filter-assignee",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "filter-assignee": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "assignment-send-email",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "broadcast-prepare": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "broadcast-send-emails",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "main"
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "2",
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "placeholder",
    "templateId": "kinto-gmail-notifications-v2-api-key"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": [
    "kinto",
    "notifications",
    "gmail",
    "api-key"
  ],
  "notes": "Kinto Gmail Notification Workflow (API Key Auth v2)\n\nThis is the updated workflow using API key authentication instead of OAuth.\n\n**KEY CHANGES FROM V1:**\n- Uses new endpoint: /api/trpc/users.getByRoleWithApiKey\n- Authentication: Bearer token in Authorization header\n- No need to pass hubId in request body (implicit in API key)\n- Uses environment variables: KINTO_API_KEY, KINTO_API_HOST, KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL\n\n**SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:**\n1. Generate API key: node scripts/generate-n8n-api-key.mjs <HUB_ID> 1\n2. Set n8n environment variables:\n   - KINTO_API_KEY: Your generated API key\n   - KINTO_API_HOST: Your Kinto host (e.g., kinto.example.com)\n   - KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL: Sender email address\n3. Replace 'YOUR_LLC_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID' with your actual Gmail credential ID\n4. Import this workflow into n8n cloud\n5. Activate the workflow\n\n**ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES REQUIRED:**\n- KINTO_API_KEY: API key for authentication (Bearer token)\n- KINTO_API_HOST: Kinto API host URL\n- KINTO_SENDER_EMAIL: Email address to send from\n\n**WEBHOOK PAYLOAD FORMAT:**\n{\n  \"event_type\": \"task.created|task.claimed|task.completed|task.assigned\",\n  \"task_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"task_title\": \"string\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"ISO 8601 datetime\",\n  \"status\": \"pending|in_progress|completed\",\n  \"assignee_id\": \"number (only for task.assigned)\",\n  \"hub_id\": \"uuid (not used in API key auth, but can be included)\"\n}\n\n**ENDPOINT DETAILS:**\nURL: https://{{ $env.KINTO_API_HOST }}/api/trpc/users.getByRoleWithApiKey\nMethod: POST\nAuth: Bearer {{ $env.KINTO_API_KEY }}\nPermissions: users:read\n\n**DOCUMENTATION:**\nSee API_KEY_N8N_SETUP.md for complete setup guide."
}
